; The DirectInput8 proxy entry points, exported for MSVC
; builds. GCC builds use __declspec(dllexport) instead.
; PRIVATE keeps the COM exports out of the import library,
; exactly as the system dinput8 does.
;
; The list mirrors the system dinput8's six exports exactly
; (tools\list-pe-exports.ps1 prints both for comparison).
; GetdfDIJoystick is the sixth: a caller that uses the standard
; joystick data format - c_dfDIJoystick in dinput8.lib - resolves
; it by name, and a proxy that does not forward it turns that
; caller's load or first use into a failed resolution. Missing it
; was a real defect (2026-09-17, a Steam copy's black screen at the
; front end's input init), so the parity is checked, not assumed.
LIBRARY dinput8
EXPORTS
    DirectInput8Create
    GetdfDIJoystick
    DllCanUnloadNow PRIVATE
    DllGetClassObject PRIVATE
    DllRegisterServer PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer PRIVATE
